","source_cn":"唔，附魔冷兵器？\\n不能爆炸，就是砍来砍去的，多老土啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63BFFB6E569FEFD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064303014:0":{"text":"이런 과제를 생각한 심사 위원은 틀림없이 늙다리일 거야. 나라면 폭발 화력으로 승부를 겨루자고 했을 텐데!","source_cn":"想出这道比赛题目的评委一定是个无聊的老家伙，要我说，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F37C77D9786A6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064303015:0":{"text":"오류.\n도전, 재미있다.","source_cn":"错谬。\\n挑战，有趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2CD36A441E7333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064303016:0":{"text":"마법 부여 룬, 변동 쉬움.\n에너지 압축, 고도의 폭주 위험.","source_cn":"附魔魔纹，易波动。\\n能量压缩，高度失控风险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CB449FFE367227D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064303017:0":{"text":"위력, 폭탄 초월.","source_cn":"威力，远超炸弹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F02AF825E0E48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064303018:0":{"text":"어이, 쇠대가리! 웬일로 그렇게 말을 많이 한대?","source_cn":"啧啧啧，难得见你说这么多话嘛，铁块头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58FE1AE73BCC740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064303019:0":{"text":"그럼 더 말해 봐. 그 마법 부여 어쩌고랑 이 몸의 화려한 폭발을 비교하면, 어느 쪽이 더 대단해?","source_cn":"那你再说说，那个附魔什么什么的，和本偶像轰轰烈烈的爆炸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x095F84744EAACE28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064303020:0":{"text":"그건 당연히...","source_cn":"当然是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD426FCF05CADC466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064303021:0":{"text":"잠깐, 팡팡! 쇠대가리가 말하게 둬!","source_cn":"停停，阿爆，让铁块头自己说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FF23F9FB9905545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064303022:0":{"text":"위력과 위험, 대등.","source_cn":"威力与风险，对等。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x850CD9AAB6745951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064303023:0":{"text":"룬 에너지 상승할 때마다, 필요 억제력 배로 증가.\n고위험.","source_cn":"魔纹能量每提升一次，所需压制力倍增。\\n高风险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58A7C67BDBB0FB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064303024:0":{"text":"그리고, 대회, 기한 하루.","source_cn":"且，竞赛，一天时限。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35FA1BD941921CB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064303025:0":{"text":"그래서 누가 더 대단하냐고! 근데 듣고 보니 아주 조금은 흥미가 생기네!","source_cn":"还是没有说嘛！不过听起来稍微有那么一丢丢意思了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8CECC6B286CDF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064303026:0":{"text":"8번 공방의 다크호스 선수가 맞붙을 상대는... 깊은바위 마을의 베테랑 장인, 보바 아이언후프입니다!","source_cn":"第八号工坊的黑马选手，对阵的是，来自深岩村的，资深工匠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x313C16EA0B085373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064303027:0":{"text":"보바는 뛰어난 제작 기술과... 독자적인 표준화 생산 라인으로 유명하지요!","source_cn":"博瓦以其精湛的锻造技艺和……独有的标准化生产线而闻名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC703313CE9B98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064303028:0":{"text":"보바다! 저 생산 라인은 너무 사기야! 금형을 만든 뒤에 무기를 한꺼번에 생산해서 그중 가장 좋은 것을 골라서 리스크를 최소화한다지?","source_cn":"是博瓦！他的生产线太作弊了！听说在制好模具后，能集中生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F92A089759576B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064303029:0":{"text":"다크호스도 여기서 끝이겠네. 애초에 이름도 없는 별 볼 일 없는 녀석일 거고, 운이 좋아서 2차전까지 올라온 걸 테니까.","source_cn":"这匹黑马看来要止步于此了。不过本来也只是个毫无名气的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA98DB19C57DA9FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064303030:0":{"text":"흥! 왜 다들 네가 질 거라고 생각하는 거지? 그 보바가 뭐가 그렇게 대단하다고! 낡아 빠진 생산 라인 하나 있는 것뿐이잖아. 그런 미련한 방식은 구석기 시대에나 먹히는 거라고!","source_cn":"哼！凭什么觉得你会输，那个博瓦有什么了不起的！不就是有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1475C8E661CA342E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064303031:0":{"text":"맞습니다, 맞습니다! 쿠루루 님의 팬이 저런 촌뜨기에게 질 리가 없지요!","source_cn":"就是就是！库露露大人的粉丝怎么可能输给那种土包子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35DC830528F55043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064303032:1":{"text":"고효율 생산, 최고 중 최고 선별.\n방법, 합리적.","source_cn":"高效生产，优中选优。\\n方法，合理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E2334F9E6A98D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064303033:0":{"text":"야, 너도 지금 저쪽 편드냐? 너 대체 누구 편이야?","source_cn":"喂，你还在帮对手说话？你到底哪边的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2C7C9368FBFEA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064303034:0":{"text":"내 생산 라인, 규모 크다!\n있다, 심연 아래에.","source_cn":"我的生产线，规模恢弘！\\n就在，深渊之下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F304DBBA3BCE37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064303035:0":{"text":"너한테도 생산 라인이 있어? 우와! 그럼 사탕 공장처럼, 온갖 멋진 폭탄들을 와르르 찍어낼 수 있겠네!","source_cn":"你也有生产线？哇！那不是可以像做糖果一样，哗啦啦地生产...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9791990CC93780EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064303036:0":{"text":"맞춤 제작.\n양산 가능.","source_cn":"定制化。\\n可量产。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA21B34F84A4AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064303037:0":{"text":"어! 어어어! 그럼 우리 빨리... 아, 아니다..","source_cn":"欸！欸欸欸！那我们快……不对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x261EE4E0553E7F6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064303038:0":{"text":"생산 라인은 심연 아래에 있는데, 우리가 여기로 옮겨올 수도 없잖아. 그럼 무슨 소용이야!","source_cn":"生产线在深渊下面，我们又搬不过来。说了等于白说嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE1C89B135D9FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064303039:0":{"text":"이전, 가능.\n악마 하인 도움, 고효율 생산.","source_cn":"搬迁，即可。\\n役使恶魔仆从，高效生产。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6BBFCAEF694C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064303040:0":{"text":"안 돼! 심연에 있는 생산 라인을 통째로 드워프 구역에 옮겨오면 어떡하자는 거야! 아예 여기에 대악마가 왔다고 소문을 내지 그래?","source_cn":"不行！怎么能把一整套深渊生产线搬到矮人的地盘上！生怕别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0B44E34D416DDFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064303041:0":{"text":"대회는 계속 참가해야 할 거 아냐! 꽉 막힌 드워프들이 분명 우리를 쫓아다닐 거라고. 특히 조아가!","source_cn":"我们还比不比赛了！那群矮人老古板肯定会追着我们跑的，尤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1647961073C23633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064303042:0":{"text":"...\n합리적. 나, 심연으로 복귀.","source_cn":"……\\n合理，我将重返深渊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAB125F14730416","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064303043:0":{"text":"군나르가 손을 들자 포신 끝에 섬뜩한 느낌의 에너지가 모였고, 그는 공방 안의 텅 빈 한쪽 구석을 겨누었다.","source_cn":"勒图姆抬起手，炮管出凝聚令人心悸的能量，对准了工坊内一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CD54D4D67F0560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064303044:0":{"text":"그러자 귀를 찢는 듯한 파열음이 울리고, 어둠의 기운을 내뿜는 심연의 통로가 열렸다.","source_cn":"刺耳的撕裂声响起，一道散发着黑暗气息的深渊通道开启。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5BF33C0A9CBF90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064303045:0":{"text":"무기 제작 완료 후 귀환.","source_cn":"待武器制作完毕，返回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A12D4824ED585D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064303046:0":{"text":"말을 마친 군나르는 심연의 통로 속으로 들어갔다. 통로는 격렬하게 일렁였지만 완전히 닫히지는 않았다.","source_cn":"勒图姆说完，身体没入深渊通道。通道剧烈地波动了一下，并...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x331E334D192067CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064303047:0":{"text":"어? 야! 야! 군나르! 돌아와! 상의도 없이 심연의 통로를 열어버리면 어떡해! 야! 아, 짜증 나 죽겠네!","source_cn":"喂？！勒图姆！给我回来！你怎么不商量一下，就把深渊通道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABA2DEC70C1CD75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064303048:0":{"text":"쿠, 쿠루루 님. 이제 어쩌죠? 심연의 통로가 완전히 닫히지 않았는데...","source_cn":"库、库露露大人，现在怎么办？深渊通道还没有完全关闭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0272BDE8CE386B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064303049:0":{"text":"쿠루루가 허둥지둥 심연 통로를 봉쇄하려 애쓰던 그때, 공교롭게도 마법 통신기가 울렸다.","source_cn":"库露露手忙脚乱地试图封住深渊通道，不合时宜的是，魔法通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64C38A537DC31390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064303050:0":{"text":"어이, 꼬마. 오전 내내 통 보이지 않던데. 그때 말한 그 참가자는 지금...","source_cn":"小丫头，怎么一上午都没见到你。还有那个神秘的参赛者，他在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D808E649EDD7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064303051:0":{"text":"으, 으아악! 조아! 나, 나 아무 데도 안 갔어. 다 팡팡 때문이야!","source_cn":"哎、哎呀呀！是祖娅阿姨啊！我、我没跑哪去！是阿爆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC313242C21AB5E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064303052:0":{"text":"팡팡이 어제... 눅눅해진 포탄을 먹어서 배탈이 났나 봐. 그래서 돌봐주고 있어!","source_cn":"阿爆它昨天吃……吃了一颗受潮的炮弹，一直闹肚子，我正在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF78F3AB958D172B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064303053:0":{"text":"윽... 쿠루루 님 말이 맞다! 어제 먹은 포탄 맛이 이상했어... 그래서 지금 배가 꾸룩꾸룩 난리도 아니지...","source_cn":"唔……库露露大人说得对……昨天那颗炮弹，味道怪怪的……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6C8C0A188C22FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064303054:0":{"text":"그, 그래! 봐! 애가 이렇게 됐다니까? 못 참고 폭발이라도 하면 어떡해? 내가 돌봐줘야지.","source_cn":"对对对！你看，它都这样了！我得照顾它，万一它忍不住爆炸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8A2D7290093B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064303055:0":{"text":"그, 그러면 하던 일 해. 난 여기를 떠날 수가 없어서 먼저 끊을게.","source_cn":"那个那个，祖娅阿姨你先忙，我这边走不开，先挂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD04F2F548118045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064303056:0":{"text":"아아아아! 귀찮아 죽겠네! 이게 다 그 쇠대가리 때문이야!","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊——真是麻烦死了！都是那个铁块头害的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26D23DB3C3F0C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:88:1064303057:0":{"text":"공방 안에는 급하게 봉쇄했음에도 여전히 심연의 기운이 새어 나오는 통로와, 그 앞에서 골머리를 앓는 쿠루루만이 남았다...","source_cn":"工坊内，只留下被紧急封闭，却仍在渗出深渊气息的通道，以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4B21B735E482E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主持人冈罗":{"text":"진행자 칸로","source":"主持人冈罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:观众阿朵":{"text":"관객 아도","source":"观众阿朵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:观众泰索":{"text":"관객 타이소","source":"观众泰索"